note: every form of functions as values
to double with x:
    give back x times 2.
let f be the function double.
say call f with 3.
say f with 3.
call f with 3.
call f.
say call f.
call item 1 of handlers with "x".
call the value for "click" in events with "x" and 2.
let shout be a function taking word that gives back word followed by "!".
let greet be a function taking who (text) and count (a number):
    say who.
let ready be a function that gives back yes.
let later be a function, giving back a number:
    give back 1.
let kinds be an empty list of functions taking a number and (a function taking text) and giving back text.
let callbacks be an empty map from text to functions giving back nothing.
let function be 5.
say function plus 1.
